
This is a placeholder file. Please replace this with the actual Norse.otf font file downloaded from DaFont.

To do this:
1. Download the Norse font from https://www.dafont.com/norse.font
2. Extract the .otf file from the download
3. In Lovable's file explorer (Dev Mode), navigate to public/fonts/norse.otf
4. Delete this placeholder file
5. Upload your actual norse.otf file in its place

The font is already configured in index.html and tailwind.config.ts to work once you upload the real font file.
